    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Chrome socket ratchet with a square drive, reversing lever, quick-release button, recessed head plate and a shaped handle with grip flutes. Both faces of the head are modelled and the top view shows the drive square and retaining detail. Polished metal shows plausible micro-scratching with no UV seam and no stamped brand name.",
